The function does a good job in checking if the scheme is either 'http' or 'https', but it might be worth considering adding more secure schemes as well in the future, thereby increasing the security layer of your application. 

In terms of confidence level, we can consider this code block to have moderate confidence level since it has done a good job in preventing potential URL misuse and bypassing but there is still room for improvement based on our analysis.
