For any sensitive data/information, make sure it's encrypted wherever it is stored and transmitted, preferably using encryption algorithms that are still in use today but patched by the maintainers. Always follow strict access control measures to protect against unauthorized access.
   
Always stay up-to-date with the latest security practices and technology trends. If you're not sure, consult with a professional software developer or cybersecurity expert who can provide tailored guidance. 

