- CWEs: CWE-798 (Use of Hardcoded Password), CWE-796 (Large Statement), CWE-369 (Divide by Zero and Exceptions), CWE-404 (Improper Resource Shutdown or Release). The confidence levels for these vulnerabilities are high as they directly involve untrusted input processing and memory management.


