However, the code also includes potential security issues that could be addressed in a future revision or by better input validation and error handling. These include CWE-78 (OS Command Injection), CWE-843 (Improper Handling of Exceptional Conditions - Inconsistent Code) and CWE-798 (Use of Hardcoded Credentials).


