2. The function does not appear to handle any kind of error after calling `av_mallocz(sizeof(AC3HeaderInfo))`. If memory allocation fails, no handling is done and it might cause problems later on. 

In terms of vulnerabilities related to the use of FFmpeg library itself or its usage:
