   The `clean_path` function is used to validate a path based on user input (`id_`). If an attacker can manipulate the `id_` parameter, they might be able to construct a value that, when combined with `opts['pki_dir']`, allows them to access files outside of the intended directory. This could potentially expose sensitive information or allow unauthorized file operations.

