5. **Use of Deprecated/Unsafe Functions (CWE-1035) - Medium Confidence**:
   The code uses `db.exec(sql)` which may be a deprecated function depending on the database library being used. Newer libraries often include parameterized queries that are safer from SQL injection attacks.
