7. **Side Channel Mitigation**:
   - Normalize timing behavior for different PPM types to reduce the risk of side-channel attacks:
     ```c
     void process_ppm(j_compress_ptr cinfo) {
       TRACEMS(cinfo, 1, JTRC_START_PROCESS);
       // Processing code here
       TRACEMS(cinfo, 1, JTRC_END_PROCESS);
     }
     ```

By addressing these areas, the security posture of the PPM parser can be significantly improved, making it more robust against a variety of potential attacks.
