      CWE-404 (Improper Resource Shutdown or Release) - Low Confidence,
      CWE-783 (Function Call with Incorrectly Specified Arguments) - Low Confidence,
      CWE-215 (Information Exposure Through Discrepancy) - Low Confidence,
      CWE-502 (Deserialization of Untrusted Data) - Low Confidence
</analysis>

