- CWE-78 (OS Command Injection) - Medium Confidence
- CWE-20 (Uncontrolled Resource Consumption) - Medium Confidence
- CWE-469 (Use of Pointer Subtraction to Determine Offset from Target Buffer) - Low Confidence

These vulnerabilities could lead to crashes, memory corruption, or other security issues in the image processing library.
</analysis>

