                  TIFFWriteScanline(tiff, pixels + y * image->columns, 0);
              }
        }
    ```

### Conclusion:
This function is designed to write images in various formats (RGB, CMYK, Grayscale, Palette) into a TIFF file with support for different compression methods. It carefully manages memory and handles exceptions that may occur during the writing process.

