CWEs:
- CWE-476 (NULL Pointer Dereference) - Medium Confidence
- CWE-754 (Improper Check for Unusual or Exceptional Conditions) - Medium Confidence
- CWE-1236 (Improper Handling of Special Elements) - Low Confidence
- Error Propagation without Context (not a standard CWE, but worth noting)

