4. CWE-732 (Insufficient Control Flow Enforcement) - Low Confidence

These findings assume that `afGetVirtualFrameSize`, `afReadFrames`, and `afWriteFrames` are part of a trusted library, which is reasonable but should be confirmed in the context of the full codebase.
</analysis>

