CWEs: CWE-190 (Integer Overflow) - High Confidence, CWE-835 (Loop with Unintended Exit Condition) - Medium Confidence, CWE-703 (Improper Check or Handling of Exceptional Conditions) - High Confidence, CWE-119 (Improper Restriction of Operations within the Bounds of a Memory Buffer) - Low Confidence.

